;; Overview button — the bottom-left corner cell, left of the Start button, so
;; a mouse thrown into the corner lands on it. Opens the hyprexpo workspace
;; overview on every screen, exactly what mod+x does (see the
;; Overview section of hyprland.lua), for when a hand is on the mouse rather
;; than the keyboard. Clicking a tile, Escape or mod+x closes it again.
;; Plugin calls are Lua functions since Hyprland 0.57, hence `eval`, not
;; `dispatch`. No active state: eww can't see whether the overview is open, and
;; while it is, it covers the bar anyway. Glyph is MD view-grid (U+F0570) —
;; four separate tiles, kept distinct from the Start button's FA bars (U+F0C9).
(defwidget overview-button []
  (button :class "overview"
          :tooltip "Overview (mod+x)"
          :onclick "hyprctl eval 'hl.plugin.hyprexpo.expo(\"toggle all\")'"
          "󰕰"))
